### Environment — NEVER commit real secrets
# Root .env is committed (contains only dev defaults)
# Local overrides with real secrets must be in .env.local
# Production secret file must never be committed either
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.prod
backend/.env.local
backend/.env.*.local

